==English==
{{was wotd|2006|January|22}}

===Etymology===
First attested in 1432. From {{der|en|enm|topographye}}, from {{der|en|la|topographia}}, from {{der|en|grc|τοπογραφία|}}, from {{m|grc|τόπος||place}} + {{m|grc|γράφω||I write}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/təˈpɒɡɹəfi/}}
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|en|/təˈpɑɡɹəfi/}}
* {{audio|en|en-au-topography.ogg|Audio (AU)}}
* {{hyphenation|en|top|og|raphy}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~|topographies}}

# A [[precise]] [[description]] of a [[place]].
# A [[detail]]ed [[graphic]] [[representation]] of the [[surface]] [[feature]]s of a place or [[object]].
# The features themselves; [[terrain]].
# The [[surveying]] of the features.

